    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/florist-elementor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Florist Elementor Theme is an ideal solution for florists, flower shops, and floral businesses. It provides an elegant and user-friendly platform for showcasing your creations, whether you specialize in modern, vintage, or exotic floral arrangements. Perfect for promoting get-well flowers, wedding bouquets, holiday flower packages, or personalized floral gifts, this theme allows you to create a visually stunning online presence with minimal effort. Built using Elementor, it offers a simple drag-and-drop interface and flexible customization features, making it easy to design pages for luxury flower collections, seasonal bouquets like spring or autumn flowers, and subscription flower delivery services. Tailored for boutique and premium floral services, it supports content blocks for event flowers, bridal floral accessories, and corporate floral packages. You can beautifully highlight handcrafted bouquets, floral gift cards, romantic flowers, and elegant designs for special occasions. The theme is also ideal for businesses offering same-day delivery, eco-friendly flowers, or local flower delivery, helping elevate your floral brand with optimized design, engaging layouts, and mobile responsiveness."
    },
